"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A Ukrainian drone attack on Russia has been one of the deadliest since the war between Moscow and Ukraine began.\",            \"english_title\": \"Deadly Drone Attack\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un ataque de dron de Ucrania a Rusia ha sido uno de los m\u00e1s mortales desde que comenz\u00f3 la guerra entre Mosc\u00fa y Ucrania.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque de Dron Mortal\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Typhoon Dolphin has hit eastern China, including Shanghai, with strong winds and heavy rain.\",            \"english_title\": \"Typhoon Dolphin Hits China\",            \"translated_version\": \"El tif\u00f3n Dolphin ha golpeado el este de China, incluyendo Shangh\u00e1i, con vientos fuertes y mucha lluvia.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tif\u00f3n Dolphin Golpea China\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Israel's Prime Minister says their military will stay in Gaza until Hamas is truly disarmed.\",            \"english_title\": \"Israel's Military in Gaza\",            \"translated_version\": \"El primer ministro de Israel dice que su ej\u00e9rcito se quedar\u00e1 en Gaza hasta que Hamas est\u00e9 realmente desarmado.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ej\u00e9rcito de Israel en Gaza\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"In British Columbia, a wildfire called Bald Range has spread over 53 square miles and caused one death.\",            \"english_title\": \"Wildfire in British Columbia\",            \"translated_version\": \"En Columbia Brit\u00e1nica, un incendio llamado Bald Range se ha extendido por 53 millas cuadradas y ha causado una muerte.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incendio en Columbia Brit\u00e1nica\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Italy's culture minister announced a significant underwater archaeological discovery, calling it one of the most important in years.\